# Three free-standing walls and an opening: nothing pinned but one end, lengths free.
wall wa from 0,0 to 6000,0 thick 200
wall wb from 0,0 to 0,4000 thick 200 left
wall wc from 6000,0 to 6000,4000 thick 100 length 4000
opening o1 1200 in wa.left
perpendicular wa.left wb.left
parallel wb.left wc.left
fix wa.left.start
